    "Original public HermiteInterpolation stays on the original kernel for clamp-eligible direct calls; all nine real caller sites enter private clamped sampler when eligible; helper invocation asserted.",
    "HF_REG=2 and HERMITE_FAST=2 retain identical periodic diagnostic text hashes and zero production output/history/return mismatch counters.",
    "ASan+UBSan on the complete public corpus; no sanitizer diagnostics in either arm."
  ],
  "observation_scope": [
    "Sampler: raw XYZ float words, histories, integer return, input parameter/key immutability, error log count/hash and diagnostic log count/hash.",
