    "Production VecRadLimit and getPartsPtr bodies included. Rotation/translation/scale helpers are deterministic recorded edges, so no quaternion or full real matrix arithmetic claim.",
    "Fixture counters instrument the actual private entry/helper and all nine caller statements; counters establish exercised paths and are not production changes."
  ],
  "adaptations": [
    "Established host fixed-width types and pointer-width adaptation",
    "Fixture-only u16_un alias matching source unaligned halfword contract",
    "HF_ASM host edge uses original C sampler; target assembly requires separate checks",
    "MotionMoveCore native lease pass-through and MAP_32BIT synthetic key image",
    "Unchanged matrix helpers are deterministic recorded edges; VecRadLimit and getPartsPtr are production bodies",
    "Fixture-only helper-entry and nine caller-site counters establish route coverage"
  ],
  "exclusions": [
    "Empty tracks and first-axis search exhaustion can read uninitialized preexisting sampler values and are not defined test inputs.",
    "One-key interior interpolation and type15 tangent interpolation are excluded; only defined exact/clamp/loop-to-exact cases are used.",
